  "purpose": "Conditional, preparation-only co-adaptation control at the identical lr 3e-05, data, loss, readouts and budget as the amended smaller-step arm. Its only changed axis is gradient scope: the six projector tensors plus the last SigLIP2 encoder block (16 tensors) and vision_model.post_layernorm (2 tensors) receive gradients, for 24 tensors and 18,631,424 parameters. The sealed MiniCPM5 decoder and frozen encoder layers 0-10, embeddings and head never receive gradients. This file amends the v1 accounting to derived identities, implements a conditional native runner, and remains ineligible and unauthorized until the preserved smaller-step failure, the frozen-feature diagnosis and a separate external receipt all exist.",
